    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπαιόφορ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing
				trophies,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.293.24
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <i>bearing a trophy</i> or <i>emblem of victory</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς τ.,</span>
			= Lat.<i>Jupiter Feretrius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Mon.Anc.Gr.
				10.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκόνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a coin, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				1439
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Cb</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1443
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				i 141
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= Lat. <i>triumphalis,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομπή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.31
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁψίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					49.15
				</span></i>
			.</div>
